---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - Letter Lab" description="Privacy Policy for Letter Lab text utilities.">
  <div class="px-6 md:px-40 flex flex-1 justify-center py-10">
    <div class="max-w-[800px] flex-1 text-[#111418]">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-[#637588] mb-8">Last updated: October 2025</p>

      <div class="space-y-8">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">1. Overview & Data Security</h2>
          <p class="text-base text-[#4f5d6d] leading-relaxed">
            At Letter Lab, we respect your privacy. All text input processed by our online tools (such as case conversions) is handled strictly inside your web browser (client-side). We do not store, log, or transmit the text content you transform to external servers or databases.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">2. Cookies, Advertising & Analytics</h2>
          <p class="text-base text-[#4f5d6d] leading-relaxed mb-3">
            We use standard third-party web analytics services, including <strong>Google Tag Manager / Google Analytics</strong> (GTM-NBTNGL9D) and <strong>Yandex Metrika</strong>, to analyze aggregate website traffic and improve user experience.
          </p>
          <p class="text-base text-[#4f5d6d] leading-relaxed mb-3">
            These services set cookies to collect anonymous technical data (such as browser type, operating system, and page views). Third-party vendors may also use cookies to serve relevant contextual ads.
          </p>
          <p class="text-base text-[#4f5d6d] leading-relaxed">
            <strong>No text typed or converted in Letter Lab is ever recorded, transmitted, or processed by these analytics tools.</strong>
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
  <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">3. Contact Us</h2>
  <p class="text-base text-[#4f5d6d] leading-relaxed">
    If you have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy or the tool's data processing, feel free to reach out via{" "}
    <a href="/about" class="text-[#3289e7] font-semibold hover:underline">About Page</a>,{" "}
    connect on{" "}
    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/sergei-tikhomirov-pm/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#3289e7] font-semibold hover:underline">LinkedIn</a>,{" "}
    or open an issue on{" "}
    <a href="https://github.com/Sidspirit/letterlab" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#3289e7] font-semibold hover:underline">GitHub</a>.
  </p>
</section>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>